"The System sends Disaster Alerts, Updates and Advisories naming a threat and advice."
"Alerts move from Imminent to Confirmed and may rate the probability of chaos exposure."
"A Global Advisory can announce that nonessential Contract services on Earth have halted."
"Delivery drones repeat Disaster Alert messages aloud when they detect people."
"A chaos siren wails across Anesidora in chaos emergencies."
"Local updates point people to shelters and report when one, like Bunker Street, is full."
"Only a few Anesidoran shelters are chaos-rated and shielded."
